Welcome to the Rust Playground!
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Toolchains   stable · beta · nightly
 Targets      x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu · musl
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
 PROJECT
   cargo new <name>       Create a new project
   cargo run              Compile and run
   cargo build            Build without running
   cargo check            Fast type check
   cargo clean            Remove build artifacts

 CODE QUALITY
   cargo fmt              Auto-format code
   cargo clippy           Lint and catch mistakes
   cargo test             Run your test suite

 DEPENDENCIES
   cargo add <crate>      Add a dependency
   cargo update           Update dependencies
   cargo doc --open       Open docs in browser

 WATCH MODE
   cargo watch -x run     Auto-recompile on save
   cargo watch -x test    Auto-test on save

 TOOLCHAIN SWITCHING
   cargo +beta   <cmd>    Run with beta toolchain
   cargo +nightly <cmd>   Run with nightly toolchain
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Have fun building with Rust! 🦀
